sudo apt-get install nginx-extras
```

Next, you should create a configuration file for your RTMP server. You can edit the `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` file or create a new one. Replace the existing nginx.conf file with the following content:

```nginx
worker_processes  1;

events {
  worker_connections  1024;
}

