In this case, you will choose your own stream key, as the key serves as a unique identifier for your stream. For example, if your server IP is 192.168.1.100, the port is 1935, the application name is "live" (as per the given configuration), and you choose "myStream" as your stream key, your RTMP URL would be:

```
