What is the most efficient way to sort a list of movies based on their ratings in descending order in MATLAB? I have a list of movies with their ratings stored in a matrix as shown below:
movies = ["The Shawshank Redemption", "The Godfather", "The Dark Knight", "12 Angry Men", "Schindler's List";
